{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the proud owner of a building. Through cutting-edge simulation technology, you can experience the following:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at your building in stunning 3D with rotation and zoom controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP and prestige stars for your building variations by watching them in all their glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a nice song. Or mute it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cosmetic Items</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While observing your building, you will unlock new skins in your inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your building into a bustling mall, a frozen apartment, an overgrown skyscraper and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade, sell or hoard your skins for eternity on the Steam Marketplace.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drop Chances</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An item is dropped every 3 hours of consecutive playtime.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Common\u00a0</strong>\u2014 60%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncommon</strong>\u00a0\u2014 30%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare\u00a0</strong>\u2014 6.5%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Rare</strong>\u00a0\u2014 3.4%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique\u00a0</strong>\u2014 0.1%</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Your Building","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566300/7812f69f425333d05f208f5ac15ea8b61f91b37a.jpg"},{"name":"One Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3566300/b14b42a82a4fd6974f9f12762832fc9e16e2509d.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566300?t=1771182940","backgrou